{"title":"8 ft Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003cp\u003eIncorporating a 8 Foot Artificial Christmas Tree into your holiday decor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWelcome to the regal world of King of Christmas, where our 8-foot artificial Christmas tree collection reigns supreme! Upgrade your holiday festivities with these majestic trees, standing tall and proud to make a grand statement in homes with higher ceilings. Our carefully curated collection showcases a variety of styles, colors, and lighting options, ensuring there's a perfect match for every festive vision.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur 8 ft Artificial Christmas Tree Features\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach 8-foot beauty in our collection is meticulously handcrafted, embodying the spirit of the season with exceptional attention to detail. The convenience of setup is a gift we give you - each tree comes in hinged sections and includes gloves for a hassle-free assembly. Say goodbye to the stress of post-holiday cleanup with the included storage bag, keeping your tree safe and sound until the next joyous season.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e8 ft Artificial Christmas Tree Colors \u0026amp; Styles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore the diversity within our collection as you choose from full-bodied, slim, or pencil tree styles, allowing you to tailor your holiday centerpiece to fit seamlessly into your space. The magic doesn't stop there – opt for the classic needle tips, realistic needle tips, or a delightful blend of both, adding a touch of authenticity to your festive display. King of Christmas takes pride in delivering not just a tree, but an experience. Join us in transforming your holiday into a spectacle with our stunning 8-foot Christmas trees, offering a touch of elegance and grandeur to your seasonal celebrations. It's time to make your home the enchanting haven of holiday magic!\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-unlit","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642895167552,"sku":"PF-T8-U","price":219.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-11_5e399119-a4fe-4d26-8c77-bde58886c97f.jpg?v=1718158952"},{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896379968,"sku":"PF-T8-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d.jpg?v=1714675448"},{"product_id":"8-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-unlit","title":"8' King Noble Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Green \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642910404672,"sku":"KNF-T8-U","price":379.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-3_9f3b6f73-20b3-43ae-8a1e-a6149a2169cb.jpg?v=1718158913"},{"product_id":"8-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-led","title":"8' King Noble Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Green \/ LED","offer_id":28642910732352,"sku":"KNF-T8-L","price":659.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/King-Noble-Fir-v1_c095ac76-493d-4cf8-9b52-448d29b1df1b.png?v=1714672831"},{"product_id":"8-foot-tribeca-blue-spruce-tree-unlit","title":"8' Tribeca Blue Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the joy and natural beauty of a Colorado winter into your home with our Tribeca Spruce, inspired by the magnificent Colorado Blue Spruce. Expertly handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, each tree flawlessly replicates the bluish-green needles and elegant form of a genuine Blue Spruce tree. Perfect for festive gatherings, it adds warmth, charm, and holiday cheer to any space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642913452096,"sku":"TBS-T8-U","price":349.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/FlockedGroup-7_38d1a301-d01f-445c-b500-c0c3c60d9dc1.jpg?v=1718158867"},{"product_id":"8-foot-tribeca-blue-spruce-tree-led","title":"8' Tribeca Blue Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree with 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the joy and natural beauty of a Colorado winter into your home with our Tribeca Spruce, inspired by the magnificent Colorado Blue Spruce. Expertly handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, each tree flawlessly replicates the bluish-green needles and elegant form of a genuine Blue Spruce tree. Perfect for festive gatherings, it adds warmth, charm, and holiday cheer to any space.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642915123264,"sku":"TBS-T8-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/TribecaSpruce_9435ba0f-6c63-4ca1-97ab-5e2cdca47270.jpg?v=1722014341"},{"product_id":"8-foot-queen-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"8' Queen Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree With 700 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":37749584396488,"sku":"QFS-T8-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlockSlim_b6755209-8c14-4ff2-9200-f44d0f609b19.jpg?v=1722012680"},{"product_id":"8-foot-alpine-fir-tree-unlit","title":"8' Alpine Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":41323990319304,"sku":"AFG-T8-U","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/AlpineFirUnlit_e7bbaf38-94dc-4442-90d4-f2cbb34b58c1.jpg?v=1722886595"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-trees_3e9e119c-dda3-42cc-a0dc-adee909a321d.jpg?v=1666795571","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/8-foot-artificial-christmas-trees.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}